            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Dano_77"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The was a good recipe, the results was a very nicely balanced cookie that is a little chewy. I got tired of chopping nuts and only used 1 cup of nut instead of 2 and the finish seemed right. I tried a chocolate chip version of this recipe by cutting the white sugar in have and replacing it with brown sugar this turned out well too."
          },
